    "media:imagetext": "The luxurious Boeing 747 is the world's\nlargest commercial passenger aircraft.\nWing span, 195.7 ft. (59.6 meters).\nLength 231.3 ft. (70.5 meters). Fuel\ncapacity 42.481 imp. gals (192,500 Itrs).\nMax. take-off weight, 775,000 Ibs. (351.540 kgms.)\nCruising speed.\n560 mph (900 kmh). The 747s are part of\nCP Air's modern fleet of orange jets serving five continents.\nLe luxueux Boeing 747 est le plus gros avion commercial du\nmonde. Enverqure des ailes, 195.7 pi. (59.6 mètres).\nLongueur, 231.3 pi (70.5 mètres). Capacité des réservoirs:\n42.481 gal. imp. (192,500 litres). Poids max, au décollage.\n775,000 Ib. (351.540 kgms). Vitesse de croisière, 560 m/h\n(900 k/h). Les 747 font partie de la flotte moderne de jets\norangers de CP Air qui dessert cinq continents.\nAir\nAlajestic\nPOST\nCARD\nPOSTAGE\nSTAMP\nT103C\nKC-3674A",
